## Conclusion

This project demonstrates the use of Python for mobile application usage and user engagement analysis. By using Pandas and NumPy, the dataset is processed and analyzed to identify user behavior, feature popularity, session duration, device preferences, ratings, and engagement patterns.

The analysis helps transform raw data into meaningful insights that can support better understanding of mobile app usage and improve the overall user experience.
